sequenceDiagram
    actor Receptionist
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as HMS REST API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (planned)
    actor Doctor
    actor LabTech
    Note over UI,DB: Planned MVP flow; domain endpoints are not implemented in the scaffold
    Receptionist->>UI: Register patient
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/patients
    API->>DB: Save patient
    API-->>UI: 201 Created
    Receptionist->>UI: Request appointment
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/appointments
    API->>DB: Check and reserve clinician slot atomically
    alt conflict
      API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
    else available
      API-->>UI: 201 Created
    end
    Doctor->>UI: Start encounter / order test
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/encounters and lab-orders
    LabTech->>UI: Enter result (synthetic)
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/lab-orders/{id}/results
    Doctor->>UI: View result
